ng parental controls for an individual requires approval from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the owner of the device.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The system displays a biometric authentication alert on the individual’s device","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after the individual approves or denies the authorization request.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The system sends the result to your app’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"AuthorizationCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Family Controls framework prevents child users, authorized by a parent or guardian,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from performing actions that might circumvent the parental controls settings.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, authorizing an app prevents the child user from deleting the app that provides parental controls.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition, while a device has at least one app authorized for parental controls by a parent or guardian,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user can’t sign out of iCloud.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a compatible iPad or iPhone app running in visionOS, authorization attempts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always fail.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Authorizations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.FamilyControls\/documentation\/FamilyControls\/AuthorizationCenter","doc:\/\/com.apple.FamilyControls\/documentation\/FamilyControls\/AuthorizationStatus","doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/BundleResources\/Entitlements\/com.apple.developer.family-controls","doc:\/\/com.apple.FamilyControls\/documentation\/FamilyControls\/requ